# Zolai Explorer — production build settings (committed on purpose)
#
# The deployed studio lives on its own host (https://studio.zolai.space/), so the
# bundle is cross-origin from the API and MUST address the API absolutely.
# Without this the relative default `/api/v1` would resolve against
# studio.zolai.space and every panel would 404.
#
# Contains no credential. `VITE_*` values are inlined into the public bundle by
# design — never put a key here. The API key is entered in the app and kept in
# localStorage only (see AGENTS.md).
VITE_API_BASE=https://api.zolai.space/api/v1